# ---- TLS material ----
# The dev key is a PRIVATE KEY. It must never enter the repository.
# Regenerate a local pair with: node tools/gen-cert.mjs
tools/dev-key.pem
tools/dev-cert.pem
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# ---- debug screenshots ----
# ~590 MB of parameter-sweep captures used while tuning the renderer.
# Anchored to the repo root so it cannot also swallow docs/shots/.
/shots/

